      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "bf211f517129f27077ac7d2d2cf4fa42959fd18b15855ea8404458377eb08efe:000002_3810527430979710304:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "主人公たちの活躍によって、\nモンスター娘たちを襲う魔導巡洋艦は撃破された。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "0b32a1e0a53f0c71f7b05ae562e674c1a4bb7a113d25ee30626850d27d519809",
